' Changes relative to the previous version (v35 -> v36, Migration36 rebuilds all 21 tables):
' - Foreign keys are enforced: PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON is set in onOpen.
' - Empty references are NULL (were -1 or 0): PayeeId, CategoryId, ProjectId, SimpleDebtId, DepartmentId, LocationId, DestAccountId, ParentId, DefaultCategoryId, CurrencyId.
' - ref_Currencies.DecimalCount is limited to 0..8 (CHECK).
' - Money is INTEGER in minor units of the account currency: Amount, StartBalance, CreditLimit, StartAmount, Price, budget Amount, Income, Expense (were REAL).
' - ExchangeRate is INTEGER, rate x 10^12 (1.0 = 1000000000000); Quantity is INTEGER, quantity x 10^3 (1.0 = 1000).
' - Removed: FBID, TS, Dirty, LastEdited from every table; ref_Debts.SrcAccount; ref_Locations.Radius; ref_Categories.Sign. Common columns are only _id and Deleted.
' - Kept: log_Transactions.FN, FD, FP.
' - Renamed: *ID -> *Id (SetId, AccountId, ParentId, TransactionId, ProductId, CategoryId, ProjectId); Currency -> CurrencyId; Payee/Category/Project/Department/Location/SimpleDebt -> *Id;
'   SrcAccount/DestAccount -> SrcAccountId/DestAccountId; Account (ref_Debts) -> AccountId; Debt -> DebtId; Category (ref_budget) -> CategoryId; DefCategory -> DefaultCategoryId;
'   CustomOrder -> OrderNumber; COLOR -> Color; AutoCreated -> IsAutoCreated; Split -> IsSplit; Closed -> IsClosed; DateTimeRB -> DateTime; Sender (log_Incoming_SMS) -> SenderId.
' - New or changed FK: log_Running_Balance (AccountId, TransactionId) and log_Incoming_SMS.SenderId now declared; log_Products.TransactionId is CASCADE (was SET NULL); ref_Debts.PayeeId is nullable (SET NULL).
' - UNIQUE (..., Deleted) on references is replaced by unique indexes WHERE Deleted = 0; indexes get a uniform name idx_<table>_<columns>; indexes added on every FK column.
@enduml
